events.description:
2026 U Can Finish 5 Miles & 2 Miles, presented by AdventHealth; 
Date: Sunday, October 11, 2026; 
Shift: 5:00 AM – 10:30 AM; 
Location: University of Central Florida Memory Mall, Orlando; 
 
Examples of volunteer positions are runner bib pick-up, course water stops, and setting up the finish line with medals, bottled water, and refreshments (bananas, granola bars, etc.). More specific volunteer instructions will be given on the day of the event.
 
Please fill out this quick event sign-up form if you plan to attend: https://forms.gle/RX4cREy6y31aDT5y7 
 
The BMES Discord will be used for instant notifications on the day of the event: https://discord.gg/VxzcvFP6r 

Hosted by: The Biomedical Engineering Society at UCF

Additional Information can be found at: https://knightconnect.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12857299
